WEBVTT

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:00.181
listing our companies every day,

00:01:00.223 --> 00:01:03.434
dominating Nasdaq
and London Stock Exchange?

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:05.603
Let me tell you what I think.

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:08.439
I love the hero's journey.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:12.360
I can often be found on Reddit
late into the night,

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.403
after I've put the children to bed,

00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:17.490
arguing about many fantastical worlds.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.284
And I'm always secretly delighted

00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:22.620
that the people
on the other side of the screen

00:01:22.662 --> 00:01:27.792
could never guess that the fierce figure
arguing about Middle Earth canon

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:31.087
and the ways of
the Basilisk Isles in Sothoryos